SUMMARY:5-7 PM organic produce baskets - Ferme de Nadir
LOCATION:La Vieille Chéchette\, Bruxelles
URL:https://chechette.be/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
DESCRIPTION:Fresh vegetables year-round! Each year\, households commit to
  picking up a basket of vegetables weekly and building local food sovere
 ignty. This is our CSA—our Community Supported Agriculture. The basket
  contents are a delightful mix of classic vegetables and exciting new fl
 avors\, grown without synthetic fertilizers\, pesticides\, herbicides\, 
 or fossil fuel machinery\, but with plenty of love.\nhttps://chechette.b
 e/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
CATEGORIES:La Vieille Chéchette\,Food & Drink\,Food & Drink\,Sustainabil
 ity
END:VEVENT
