SUMMARY:5-7pm organic produce boxes from Nadir Farm
LOCATION:La Vieille Chéchette\, Bruxelles
URL:https://chechette.be/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
DESCRIPTION:Fresh vegetable boxes all year round! Every year\, households
  commit to picking up a weekly vegetable box and building local food sov
 ereignty. It's our CSA—our Community Supported Agriculture initiative.
  The box contents are a delightful blend of classic vegetables and excit
 ing new flavors\, which we grow without synthetic fertilizers\, pesticid
 es\, herbicides\, or fossil fuel-powered tools\, but with plenty of love
 .\nhttps://chechette.be/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
